# CODEOWNERS — sdd-standard
#
# Code owners for this repository are the standard owner — the repo
# maintainer(s). The role is defined in standard/SDD-STANDARD.md §13; an
# adopting organization designates its own standard owner and binds real
# team handles here when it hosts the standard.
#
# On hosting plans without required-review enforcement, CODEOWNERS is
# documentation only (see the README "Hosting note"). Where enforcement is
# available: create the team, uncomment, and enable required review:
#
# *  @your-org/standard-owner
#
# Each stack profile is owned by the team closest to that stack, with one
# reviewer from outside the owning team to prevent profile capture
# (SDD-STANDARD §7.4). The owning team is named when adoption creates one:
#
# /standard/profiles/backend-services/  @your-org/backend-platform
